OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulances report busy summer
OL,4,Aas demand rises
OL,5,
OL,6,FAir ambulance services reported a rise
OL,7,Fin emergency call-outs over the summer,
OL,8,Fwith increased demand putting pressure
OL,9,Fon crews and running costs.
OL,11,FCornwall Air Ambulance flew 107
OL,12,Fmissions in July and helped 84 people,
OL,13,Fwhile Devon Air Ambulance said it had
OL,14,Fbeen 7-10% busier than the same period
OL,15,Flast year.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
