OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulances report busy summer
OL,4,Aas demand rises
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth services said the increase was
OL,7,Fpartly linked to good weather and more
OL,8,Fpeople visiting the South West, with
OL,9,Froad traffic collisions, sporting
OL,10,Finjuries, illnesses and cardiac
OL,11,Femergencies among the incidents
OL,12,Fattended.
OL,14,FDevon Air Ambulance operations director
OL,15,FTania Martin said: "More people means
OL,16,Fmore likelihood of injury and illness
OL,17,Fto occur."
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
